      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Query Regarding Invoice [Invoice Number] - Discrepancy in Weight Received\n\nDear [Supplier Contact Name],\n\nI hope this email finds you well. We are currently reconciling our recent delivery, and we've noticed a slight discrepancy on Invoice [Invoice Number]. Our packing slip indicates a receipt of 500kg, but the invoice reflects a charge for 650kg.\n\nCould you please look into this for us and clarify the reason for the 150kg difference? We would appreciate it if you could send over a credit memo for the excess amount to ensure our records are perfectly aligned.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter. We look forward to your clarification.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]",
